python_rag/
│
├── main.py                          # Main entry point - runs the chatbot
├── README.md                        # Project documentation
│
├── config/                          # Configuration module
│   ├── __init__.py                  # Exports configuration constants
│   └── config.py                    # API keys, database URIs, model settings
│
├── tools/                           # LLM Tools module
│   ├── __init__.py                  # Exports tool functions
│   └── tools.py                     # Message formatting tools (beginner/advanced)
│
├── graph/                           # LangGraph workflow module
│   ├── __init__.py                  # Exports graph components
│   ├── state.py                     # State definition for the workflow
│   ├── nodes.py                     # Node functions (validate, retrieve, agent)
│   └── workflow.py                  # Graph structure and edge definitions
│
├── vector_db/                       # Vector database module
│   ├── __init__.py                  # Module documentation
│   └── push_to_vector_db.py        # Script to index documents into Qdrant
│
└── utils/                           # Utilities module
    ├── __init__.py                  # Exports utility functions
    └── chat_interface.py            # Chat loop and user interaction utilities

ORGANIZATION SUMMARY:
=====================
✅ config/      - All configuration and constants in one place
✅ tools/       - Tool definitions for LLM function calling
✅ graph/       - LangGraph workflow components (state, nodes, workflow)
✅ vector_db/   - Vector database operations and indexing scripts
✅ utils/       - Helper functions and chat interface utilities
✅ main.py      - Clean entry point that imports from organized modules
✅ README.md    - Complete project documentation
